    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -570,
        "y": 70
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "DQN (DeepMind, 2015) learned Atari from pixels by predicting one Q-value per action - the return it expects if it takes that action now. The Conv stack is the eye: four stacked greyscale frames, so a single input already shows motion. The DQN node is the head, three Linear layers turning 3136 features into 4 action values.\n\nNothing is trained here. The observation is a random tensor in place of a real frame stack, so no gym or ale-py install is needed; swap in EnvWrapper to drive it from a live environment. A real agent would add a target network, a replay buffer and a TD loss.\n\nDQN（DeepMind, 2015）從像素學會玩 Atari，做法是替每個動作預測一個 Q 值 — 也就是現在採取那個動作之後預期能拿到的回報。Conv 堆疊是它的眼睛：一次吃四張堆疊的灰階畫面，所以單一輸入就看得出動態。DQN 節點是它的頭，三層 Linear 把 3136 個特徵變成 4 個動作價值。\n\n這張圖不訓練任何東西。觀測是隨機張量，代替真正的畫面堆疊，所以不必安裝 gym 或 ale-py；要接真環境就換成 EnvWrapper。真正的代理人還需要目標網路、回放緩衝區和 TD 損失。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "note-seq-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 30
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Off the data path: only the trigger edge reaches it. It holds the same network as one layer stack - the Conv/ReLU backbone, Flatten, Linear 3136-512, ReLU, Linear 512-4. Double-click to open it in the layer editor. The DQN node's own head is one Linear deeper.\n\n它不在資料路徑上，只有 trigger 那條邊會走到它。它把同一套網路寫成一份層堆疊 — Conv/ReLU 骨幹、Flatten、Linear 3136-512、ReLU、Linear 512-4 — 雙擊可以在層編輯器裡讀完。DQN 節點自己的頭比這裡多一層 Linear。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "seq-model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -380
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "note-optimizer-1",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 700,
        "y": 1270
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Built over dqn-1's parameters and never stepped - this graph is a forward pass, and there is no loss to step it with. It is here to show where the optimizer attaches: to the agent's own network, not to seq-model.\n\n它建在 dqn-1 的參數上，但從來沒有被 step 過 — 這張圖只做前向傳播，也沒有損失可以讓它更新。它在這裡是要說明優化器接的位置：接的是代理人自己的網路，不是 seq-model。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "optimizer-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": -310
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
